WEBVTT

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:11.810
Let's see, where should we transfer...?

00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:12.400
Why are you in your uniform, of all things?

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:14.910
I thought it seemed more formal.

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:18.240
It's what I wear for weddings and funerals.

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:19.150
Wow, seriously?

00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:24.450
Hey! Get back here and apologize!

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:25.830
It's okay, Yuuka.

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:27.410
Come on. Let's go.

00:00:29.410 --> 00:00:31.880
Orine, are you hurt at all?

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:33.210
Nope. I'm fine.

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:34.540
Good to hear.

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:58.150
Went for a walk again, Kirara?

00:00:59.110 --> 00:01:01.150
Find anything interesting?

00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:03.500
I see.

00:01:04.570 --> 00:01:06.960
Come on. Let's go.

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:11.040
<i>Our scattering sweat shall turn into song.</i>

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:14.290
<i>Our flowing tears shall turn into stars.</i>

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:30.060
Even if you reach out your hand,

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:36.650
you won't be able to reach it yet.

00:01:37.610 --> 00:01:42.240
Our dreams still lie

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:47.830
much, much further in the distance.

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:44.080
Akimoto Sayaka the 10th

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:44.080
Takahashi Minami the 5th

00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:44.950
Itano Tomomi the 11th

00:01:44.290 --> 00:01:44.870
Ooshima Yuuko the 9th

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:44.910
Ooshima Yuuko the 9th

00:01:44.910 --> 00:01:44.950
Ooshima Yuuko the 9th

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:45.000
Ooshima Yuuko the 9th

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:45.040
Ooshima Yuuko the 9th

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:45.830
Kashiwagi Yuki the 6th

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:45.120
Kojima Haruna the 8th

00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:45.160
Kojima Haruna the 8th

00:01:45.160 --> 00:01:45.790
Kojima Haruna the 8th

00:01:45.790 --> 00:01:45.830
Kojima Haruna the 8th

00:01:45.830 --> 00:01:45.870
Kojima Haruna the 8th

00:01:45.870 --> 00:01:45.910
Kojima Haruna the 8th

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:46.580
Miyazawa Sae the 10th

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:46.580
Watanabe Mayu MK3

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:46.660
Maeda Atsuko the 13th

00:01:46.660 --> 00:01:46.710
Maeda Atsuko the 13th

00:01:46.710 --> 00:01:46.750
Maeda Atsuko the 13th

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:46.790
Maeda Atsuko the 13th

00:01:46.790 --> 00:01:46.830
Maeda Atsuko the 13th

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:46.870
Maeda Atsuko the 13th

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:46.910
Maeda Atsuko the 13th

00:01:46.910 --> 00:01:46.960
Maeda Atsuko the 13th

00:01:47.420 --> 00:01:47.460
Maeda Atsuko the 13th

00:01:48.330 --> 00:01:51.710
Even the stars of the sky

00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:54.840
lie billions of lightyears away,

00:01:54.960 --> 00:02:00.890
shining beyond the shadows.

00:02:00.890 --> 00:02:07.140
Let me speak of hope,

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:13.190
like a nameless poet: with passion.

00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:19.240
If you find yourself broken down in tears,

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:24.700
then rather than consoling you,

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:31.380
let me speak of the coming dawn.

00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:44.600
- The Chosen Lights-

00:02:46.090 --> 00:02:48.810
No... No... I can't do this...

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:52.560
Why can't the second round be judged digitally, too?

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:54.980
A mere wall stands between me and the vacuum—

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:56.570
the void of death!

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:02.730
Wh-What's that thing? An asteroid?

00:03:02.730 --> 00:03:03.820
Is this the asteroid belt?

00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:06.040
Nobody told me about <i>this!</i>

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:07.200
It's all over!

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:10.080
Yokomizo Makoto's life ends today!

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:14.000
If one of those rocks crashes into the ship, we're all doomed!

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:17.050
My only regret is not making it to the auditions!

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:21.920
Dad, Mom, I'm sorry for not listening!

00:03:32.510 --> 00:03:33.470
Did she come this way?

00:03:33.470 --> 00:03:36.690
Little brat, stowing away and stealing our food...

00:03:36.690 --> 00:03:38.140
Once we find her, out the airlock she goes!

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:47.200
Are they gone?

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:53.120
Who are you? Part of the crew?

00:03:54.160 --> 00:03:55.130
No...

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:58.250
Gosh, don't scare me like that.

00:03:58.870 --> 00:04:03.680
Don't tell anyone on the crew that Sonata is here.

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:05.300
Sonata?

00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:06.010
Yep.

00:04:08.550 --> 00:04:10.340
That's me, Sonata!

00:04:10.340 --> 00:04:11.640
Since it's come to this,

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:14.100
I'll give you my autograph so you won't blab.

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:20.690
Sonata's gonna join AKB soon,
so this will be worth a lot in the future!

00:04:20.690 --> 00:04:21.560
Um...

00:04:22.310 --> 00:04:24.700
Could you write my name, too?

00:04:25.980 --> 00:04:28.070
Put "To Suzuko-san".

00:04:28.070 --> 00:04:29.950
Suzuko?

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:34.240
Suzuko... "Suzu" can also be read as "Rin" so...

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:37.290
your nickname is now officially "Linda"!

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:37.380
To Linda

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:37.500
To Linda

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:37.590
To Linda

00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:37.670
To Linda

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:38.500
To Linda

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:38.630
To Linda

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:38.750
To Linda

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:38.880
To Linda

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:39.000
To Linda

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:39.130
To Linda

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:39.250
To Linda

00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:39.550
To Linda

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:40.710
"Linda"...

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:41.580
Yep!

00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:42.290
There she is!

00:04:42.290 --> 00:04:43.540
Oh, fiddlesticks!

00:04:43.540 --> 00:04:44.000
Halt!

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:45.090
You won't get away!

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:52.590
It's beautiful...

00:04:52.590 --> 00:04:54.730
Hey, isn't that red star totally adorable?

00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:59.390
Our planet is fading into the distance.

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:01.810
Yeah...

00:05:01.810 --> 00:05:03.860
Farther and farther...

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:05.610
Hey! Quit crying!

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:07.480
B-But...

00:05:07.480 --> 00:05:11.700
Don't forget our promise.
The three of us are gonna join AKB.

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:13.070
Not just us three.

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:17.450
Oh yeah!

00:05:17.450 --> 00:05:18.240
Chieri!

00:05:18.240 --> 00:05:19.160
Yep.

00:05:19.160 --> 00:05:21.920
The girl who told us about AKB.

00:05:23.040 --> 00:05:27.430
That summer, she came to visit our planet, Lancastar.

00:05:28.210 --> 00:05:32.380
She looked well-bred, and she was
wearing those expensive frilly clothes,

00:05:32.380 --> 00:05:35.430
but she still played in the water with us.

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:38.680
We watched the concert together, didn't we?

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:43.480
It brings back memories.

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:44.310
Yeah.

00:05:44.310 --> 00:05:48.400
But do you think she still wants to join AKB?

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:50.070
I <i>know</i> she does!

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:51.900
There's no way she's forgotten our dream!

00:05:51.900 --> 00:05:54.820
We might even see her at the auditions!

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:55.740
Oh?

00:05:57.070 --> 00:05:59.130
You're trying for AKB, too?

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:00.840
Who the heck are you?

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:03.340
Sonata, of course!

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:07.420
Don't tell anyone that Sonata is here.

00:06:07.420 --> 00:06:08.550
Why not?

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:11.210
Sonata's gonna join AKB, too!

00:06:11.210 --> 00:06:11.800
Huh?

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:17.640
Y-You're auditioning for AKB, too?!

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:19.650
Yes, so am I.

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:20.640
Wha—

00:06:20.640 --> 00:06:21.770
It's Linda!

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:22.930
Come again?

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:28.030
Talk about a coincidence!

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:30.910
So you're heading for the auditions, too.

00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:34.150
W-We're all... rivals...

00:06:34.150 --> 00:06:35.450
I'm done for!

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:37.990
I must be the least talented girl here!

00:06:37.990 --> 00:06:40.160
I'm gonna fail for sure...

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:43.330
What was that for?

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:45.920
To commemorate the first failure of the auditions.

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:46.710
Just in case.

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:49.920
Don't worry!

00:06:49.920 --> 00:06:53.760
You're cute and unique, so I know you'll pass!

00:06:54.380 --> 00:06:55.840
My chicken!

00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:58.390
I was saving it for last...

00:06:59.800 --> 00:07:02.270
Why are you hiding?

00:07:02.270 --> 00:07:03.930
'Cause I don't got a ticket.

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:06.230
A stowaway?!

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:09.990
But I thought they sent tickets to everyone who passed.

00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:12.450
Except I didn't.

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:13.990
What?

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:15.780
But you said you were gonna join AKB!

00:07:15.780 --> 00:07:17.410
You're saying you failed the first round?!

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:18.410
I'm still gonna join!

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:19.960
Don't stand up, they'll find you!

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:22.030
Sonata won't give up!

00:07:22.030 --> 00:07:28.170
If they see me in person,
just once, they'll understand!

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:31.590
Have no fear.

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:36.430
There is a high probability that you will pass, Sonata-san.

00:07:36.970 --> 00:07:41.550
They say girls shorter than
154 cm have a better chance,

00:07:41.550 --> 00:07:47.150
and your shoulder-length chestnut hair resembles Paruru the 3rd, who was wildly popular.

00:07:47.810 --> 00:07:49.940
Now <i>that's</i> dedication.

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:51.400
It's common sense.

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:53.860
I'm a diehard AKB fan, after all.

00:07:53.860 --> 00:07:55.740
I-I love them too, you know!

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:57.320
I wanna pass so badly!

00:07:57.320 --> 00:08:01.080
But... I have no confidence!

00:08:01.990 --> 00:08:05.130
That concludes the entertainment news.

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:06.250
Our next story:

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:10.290
The disappearance of the daughter of Zodiac Corporation's CEO.

00:08:10.290 --> 00:08:13.290
The whereabouts of Sono Chieri-san remain unknown.

00:08:10.370 --> 00:08:12.210
What is it, Orine?

00:08:12.210 --> 00:08:14.460
She mentioned Zodiac...

00:08:13.290 --> 00:08:16.920
A careful, large-scale search is now underway.

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:19.430
The heiress of Zodiac Corporation, missing or kidnapped...?

00:08:16.920 --> 00:08:22.470
As Zodiac Corporation is a major military supplier of the D.G.T.O.,

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:19.470
The heiress of Zodiac Corporation, missing or kidnapped...?

00:08:20.390 --> 00:08:21.890
Chieri?!

00:08:22.430 --> 00:08:23.480
Do you know her?

00:08:22.470 --> 00:08:25.720
terrorist involvement is suspected.

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:24.640
Yeah.

00:08:24.640 --> 00:08:28.350
She said "Zodiac" was her father's company, didn't she?

00:08:25.720 --> 00:08:29.100
Currently, Chieri-san's safe return is top priority.

00:08:28.350 --> 00:08:30.570
Chieri is missing...?

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:32.060
I hope she's okay.

00:08:32.060 --> 00:08:32.810
You girls.

00:08:33.810 --> 00:08:34.280
Yes?

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:36.070
Wh-Wh-What is it?

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:39.370
Do you know Sono Chieri-san?

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:42.070
Yes, we do.

00:08:42.070 --> 00:08:45.870
We were notified that she might be aboard this ship.

00:08:45.870 --> 00:08:47.910
Do you know anything?

00:08:47.910 --> 00:08:49.090
This ship?

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:52.800
It seems she was headed to some sort of audition.

00:08:56.050 --> 00:08:57.920
I suppose you don't know.

00:08:57.920 --> 00:09:00.760
If you do find her, please let us know.

00:09:00.760 --> 00:09:02.220
Thank you for your cooperation.

00:09:04.550 --> 00:09:06.020
Is Chieri also going...

00:09:06.020 --> 00:09:08.180
...to the AKB auditions?

00:09:11.020 --> 00:09:12.320
Where could she be?

00:09:12.800 --> 00:09:14.940
So she <i>didn't</i> give up on our dream!

00:09:14.940 --> 00:09:16.150
I'm so happy!

00:09:16.150 --> 00:09:17.860
Don't be naïve, Orine!

00:09:17.860 --> 00:09:20.740
She must have ran away
'cause her dad was against it!

00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:22.570
Let's find her and help her!

00:09:22.570 --> 00:09:25.460
We just have to make it to the auditions together!

00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:27.410
I'm heading this way!

00:09:27.410 --> 00:09:28.540
Okay!

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:29.830
See you!

00:09:29.830 --> 00:09:30.710
We'll meet up!

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:32.830
Chieri!

00:09:32.830 --> 00:09:34.170
Where are you?

00:09:34.170 --> 00:09:35.880
It's me, Nagisa!

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:36.720
Chieri!

00:09:41.030 --> 00:09:42.070
What is it?

00:09:50.060 --> 00:09:51.360
Chieri!

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:52.120
Are you in here?

00:09:58.390 --> 00:10:00.060
You're from the spaceport...

00:10:00.060 --> 00:10:02.830
It used to glow.

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:08.370
But now... it's lost its radiance.

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:11.370
Are you looking for Sono Chieri?

00:10:11.370 --> 00:10:12.660
Do you know her?

00:10:13.580 --> 00:10:16.090
Are you going to turn her over to the crew?

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:17.210
Of course not!

00:10:17.210 --> 00:10:21.710
I want to find her, so we can
attend the auditions together!

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:27.140
If you want to pass the auditions, then you'd better turn her in.

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:31.390
They're searching for her, aren't they?

00:10:31.390 --> 00:10:33.940
Turn her over, and you've got one less rival.

00:10:34.270 --> 00:10:35.770
What are you saying?

00:10:35.770 --> 00:10:38.400
The elections. The battle of succession.

00:10:39.270 --> 00:10:44.740
Even if you pass the auditions,
everyone in AKB0048 will be your rival.

00:10:45.280 --> 00:10:48.410
Some pass, some fail.

00:10:48.410 --> 00:10:53.710
For every smile you see, someone else is crying.

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:57.970
At this stage, if you don't see the others as your rivals,

00:10:57.970 --> 00:11:02.300
then I don't imagine you'll ever join 0048.

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:02.930
Wait!

00:11:02.930 --> 00:11:05.050
What do you mean?

00:11:05.050 --> 00:11:05.930
Hey!

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:13.560
Nagisa?

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:15.190
We couldn't find Chieri.

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:17.690
Nagisa?

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:18.980
What's wrong?

00:11:24.070 --> 00:11:29.410
The ship carrying the first group is en route.

00:11:29.410 --> 00:11:32.700
There are six candidates aboard.

00:11:32.700 --> 00:11:36.370
<i>E-E-Enough tears...</i>

00:11:36.370 --> 00:11:37.460
Sensei?

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:39.380
Is that the Holy Lyric...?

00:11:40.580 --> 00:11:43.210
Does that mean those girls are...

00:11:44.050 --> 00:11:45.260
<i>Tears...</i>

00:11:48.130 --> 00:11:49.930
I shall dispatch the <i>Flying Get</i> at once.

00:11:51.550 --> 00:11:55.140
It never crossed my mind that we'd be rivals.

00:11:55.140 --> 00:11:57.520
Was I being stupid?

00:11:57.520 --> 00:11:58.560
Stupid! Stupid!

00:11:58.560 --> 00:11:59.400
Stop that!

00:12:00.730 --> 00:12:02.740
All I wanted

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:08.370
was for all of us to pass and be happy.

00:12:08.370 --> 00:12:09.450
Nagisa.

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:12.490
It's still possible. We can all pass.

00:12:12.990 --> 00:12:16.660
No way, no way! That's totally impossible!

00:12:16.660 --> 00:12:19.620
Yokomizo Makoto. Personality: Negative.

00:12:19.620 --> 00:12:20.510
Suzuko-san...

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:26.220
What are those?

00:12:29.180 --> 00:12:30.890
What's going on?

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:31.930
Could it be...?

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:34.690
A DES attack!

00:12:45.650 --> 00:12:47.570
O-Oh no! We have to run!

00:12:52.950 --> 00:12:56.000
This ship is now under the control of DES.

00:12:56.120 --> 00:12:57.330
What's the meaning of this?!

00:12:56.370 --> 00:13:03.130
We received reports that girls bound for the AKB0048 auditions are on board.

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:04.960
He's talking about us!

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:09.140
Turn yourselves over, and no harm will come to you!

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:10.220
We have to get away!

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:10.630
Yeah.

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:21.600
Over there!

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:23.310
What do we do?

00:13:23.310 --> 00:13:24.740
Don't ask, just run!

00:13:25.140 --> 00:13:26.610
Charlie calling Bravo.

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:28.240
The bridge is secured.

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:33.970
They're coming...

00:13:33.970 --> 00:13:34.570
Shh!

00:13:37.800 --> 00:13:38.490
Come back!

00:13:38.490 --> 00:13:39.040
There they are!

00:13:43.290 --> 00:13:44.550
This way!

00:13:59.230 --> 00:14:01.640
U-Um, we're...

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:13.200
Nagisa!

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:19.540
Is that 00?

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:23.370
They've hijacked the ship's intercom!

00:14:30.480 --> 00:14:32.430
It's 0048!

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:40.930
AKB0048, taking the stage!

00:14:42.140 --> 00:14:42.980
Takamina!

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:44.600
Kojiharu and Sayaka-san, too!

00:14:44.600 --> 00:14:45.780
00!

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:49.490
We'll take it from here! Find somewhere safe!

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:50.240
I was tired of everything.

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:54.280
I thought that dreams would only bring pain

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:54.200
Here I go!

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:55.830
and weren't worth the trouble.

00:14:54.450 --> 00:14:57.200
Heart attack!

00:14:56.450 --> 00:15:00.080
I wanted to just go with the flow

00:14:57.450 --> 00:15:00.040
Nyan-Nyan the 8th, at your service!

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:02.420
and eventually return to dust.

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:06.260
I even forgot the tears I had shed

00:15:05.910 --> 00:15:07.120
<i>Amazing.</i>

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:08.760
during those listless days.

00:15:07.120 --> 00:15:13.510
<i>They don't just sing, dance, and look cute. It's more than that.</i>

00:15:08.550 --> 00:15:10.880
But listen, somewhere,

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:14.600
a voice is calling out

00:15:13.510 --> 00:15:18.930
<i>Just like back then, they're risking everything and trusting each other with their lives.</i>

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:17.470
with all the force of a cheer.

00:15:17.270 --> 00:15:21.940
It's pounding its fist on the door of your heart!

00:15:18.930 --> 00:15:21.440
<i>This is what we've dreamed of...</i>

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:24.820
We are AKB!

00:15:21.930 --> 00:15:23.310
AKB...

00:15:23.310 --> 00:15:25.140
...0048!

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:27.190
Our passion is MAX!

00:15:25.140 --> 00:15:27.440
Hurry up! Head for the airlock!

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:28.440
Okay!

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:30.320
Look back now, and remember

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:33.120
the emotion you once lost.

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:33.990
Let's go!

00:15:33.780 --> 00:15:36.160
We are AKB!

00:15:34.950 --> 00:15:36.160
Down for the count!

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:39.620
Our passion is MAX!

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:39.580
What's wrong, Nagisa?

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:41.170
It's gone!

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:42.250
Call upon the burning blood

00:15:41.280 --> 00:15:42.210
It must have...

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:45.670
that races through your body

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:44.420
I forgot something!

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:45.790
Idiot! This is not the time—

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:44.950
Nagisa!

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:50.920
and blaze the trail to tomorrow!

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:48.210
Because that...

00:15:49.080 --> 00:15:53.430
I had to rush, so it might not look perfect.

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:55.050
...was from Mommy!

00:16:00.300 --> 00:16:01.430
There it is!

00:16:03.430 --> 00:16:04.850
Thank goodness.

00:16:09.820 --> 00:16:11.730
That's one target secured—

00:16:19.820 --> 00:16:22.570
U-Um, thank you for saving...

00:16:24.160 --> 00:16:25.450
Are you...?

00:16:28.520 --> 00:16:29.710
Chieri?

00:16:30.290 --> 00:16:32.920
Chieri? It's you, right?

00:16:32.920 --> 00:16:35.300
Don't you remember? I'm Nagisa.

00:16:35.300 --> 00:16:37.090
When we were kids, we...

00:16:37.090 --> 00:16:37.930
Nagisa.

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:39.300
Yes, that's right!

00:16:39.300 --> 00:16:40.800
Are you out of your mind?

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:47.180
You want to join 0048, but you can't even protect yourself?

00:16:47.180 --> 00:16:50.230
Do you want to get in the way of our mentors?

00:16:50.230 --> 00:16:51.770
I just...

00:16:51.770 --> 00:16:55.020
Yet you don't want to get in the way of your rivals?

00:16:55.020 --> 00:16:57.950
You won't become a successor with that attitude!

00:16:58.740 --> 00:16:59.740
Chieri...

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:04.160
Watch out!

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:10.490
Chieri!

00:17:10.490 --> 00:17:11.290
Go.

00:17:12.210 --> 00:17:13.420
I thought I told you.

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:17.160
Everyone in AKB0048 is a rival.

00:17:17.160 --> 00:17:19.050
This is no time to be saying that!

00:17:20.670 --> 00:17:25.560
If you don't abandon me here, you'll be the one to regret it.

00:17:25.890 --> 00:17:28.690
I won't be easy to beat.

00:17:31.560 --> 00:17:33.240
I think you're wrong.

00:17:34.520 --> 00:17:39.490
Maybe 0048 is competitive. Maybe they're all rivals.

00:17:39.490 --> 00:17:41.700
But what do you call the battle we saw?

00:17:42.570 --> 00:17:46.910
If they were all against each other,
they wouldn't have had such great teamwork.

00:17:46.910 --> 00:17:49.920
They trust their friends and support each other.

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:52.380
That's the 00 I want to join.

00:17:52.380 --> 00:17:54.090
So you don't care if you fail?

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:54.720
I won't fail!

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:55.720
You're just saying that!

00:17:56.170 --> 00:18:01.220
I <i>will</i> join 00! Together with you! I swear!

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:03.260
Nagisa...

00:18:04.470 --> 00:18:05.550
Kirara?

00:18:15.600 --> 00:18:17.030
Why?

00:18:19.020 --> 00:18:20.690
It's the birth of an idol!

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:23.360
Yuuko-san?

00:18:23.360 --> 00:18:25.000
Hi!

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:34.920
You did well.

00:18:35.540 --> 00:18:36.630
Kirara?

00:18:36.630 --> 00:18:42.100
Did you know? These critters
act as stage lighting for us, too.

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:47.810
Kirara are attracted to an idol's aura and glow in resonance with it.

00:18:47.810 --> 00:18:50.020
An idol's aura?

00:18:53.430 --> 00:18:57.940
<i>Listen to the music pounding in your head!</i>

00:18:57.940 --> 00:19:02.620
<i>Heavy Rotation!</i>

00:19:04.610 --> 00:19:07.080
Is this the radiance of a successor?

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:11.910
Wow...

00:19:12.910 --> 00:19:13.870
Up you go.

00:19:15.120 --> 00:19:16.960
Yuuko-san, I...

00:19:17.620 --> 00:19:21.480
Don't worry about it. But why is this one with you?

00:19:21.480 --> 00:19:26.130
When I was young, I went to your concert on Lancastar,

00:19:26.130 --> 00:19:28.020
and it followed me home.

00:19:30.140 --> 00:19:31.430
That's when it happened, huh?

00:19:31.430 --> 00:19:33.470
Yuuko, what are you doing?

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:36.520
I've secured two young hopefuls!

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:38.240
We're heading to the airlock!

00:19:38.240 --> 00:19:39.940
Come on! All aboard!

00:19:40.480 --> 00:19:41.610
Right!

00:19:41.610 --> 00:19:45.410
Hold on tight, it's gonna be wild!

00:19:46.530 --> 00:19:47.490
There they are!

00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:48.200
Halt!

00:19:52.450 --> 00:19:53.880
Hey! Sorry we're late!

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:54.660
No kidding!

00:19:55.200 --> 00:19:56.590
Nagisa!

00:19:56.590 --> 00:19:58.460
Yuuka! Orine!

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:02.460
Thank goodness!

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:05.050
Is that...

00:20:05.050 --> 00:20:06.720
Yeah! It's Chieri!

00:20:07.310 --> 00:20:09.800
Okay! You're safe now.

00:20:07.630 --> 00:20:09.800
No way!

00:20:10.760 --> 00:20:13.180
Um, I'm so sorry.

00:20:14.640 --> 00:20:15.600
Nagisa?

00:20:15.600 --> 00:20:16.980
Let's go.

00:20:19.560 --> 00:20:20.400
What now?

00:20:23.250 --> 00:20:24.610
Everyone, into the shuttle!

00:20:24.610 --> 00:20:25.900
Okay...

00:20:25.900 --> 00:20:27.940
Mayuyu, that suit is unmanned.

00:20:27.940 --> 00:20:28.950
Understood.

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:32.160
Missles: Armed.

00:20:32.490 --> 00:20:33.420
Target: Locked on.

00:20:33.850 --> 00:20:34.880
Fire.

00:20:38.620 --> 00:20:41.670
Mayuyu's got your back, girls!

00:20:42.670 --> 00:20:44.090
Mayuyu-san is a...

00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:45.880
Come on, let's get going!

00:20:45.880 --> 00:20:46.510
Okay!

00:20:48.010 --> 00:20:49.220
Withdraw!

00:21:07.110 --> 00:21:11.070
<i>No Kirara followed me,</i>

00:21:11.070 --> 00:21:14.120
<i>even though I was there too.</i>

00:21:14.990 --> 00:21:17.950
<i>Was Chieri chosen?</i>

00:21:19.620 --> 00:21:22.170
<i>It never glowed for me,</i>

00:21:23.290 --> 00:21:25.630
<i>even though it's followed me this entire time.</i>

00:21:28.510 --> 00:21:30.970
<i>Why did Nagisa...</i>

00:21:38.440 --> 00:21:40.060
It's a DES battleship.

00:21:40.060 --> 00:21:42.850
77th generation candidates have been secured.

00:21:42.850 --> 00:21:43.650
Okay.

00:21:43.650 --> 00:21:47.910
Attention, all hands! The ship will
now enter emergency Kirara Drive!

00:21:48.220 --> 00:21:50.620
All LAS in combat, return immediately.

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:52.900
All hands, prepare for the shockwave!

00:21:52.900 --> 00:21:54.410
Brace yourselves!

00:21:54.410 --> 00:21:57.910
This was your acting captain,
Yukirin the 6th! Over and out!

00:21:58.580 --> 00:21:59.920
Everyone, grab onto something!

00:22:00.490 --> 00:22:01.120
Okay!

00:22:22.360 --> 00:22:24.730
The stars that shine in the night sky

00:22:29.870 --> 00:22:32.410
should cast an endless shadow,

00:22:32.410 --> 00:22:35.000
the truth will make itself heard.

00:22:35.000 --> 00:22:37.660
Who shall be the one to receive

00:22:37.660 --> 00:22:40.040
the message of light

00:22:40.040 --> 00:22:42.420
set adrift on the river of time?

00:22:42.670 --> 00:22:47.550
People are born, and people die.

00:22:47.550 --> 00:22:52.010
Our bodies don't last forever.

00:22:52.890 --> 00:22:57.680
Those who rise back up from the ashes

00:22:57.680 --> 00:23:03.400
give passion to the next generation.

00:23:03.400 --> 00:23:06.780
Dreams are like reincarnation.

00:23:07.240 --> 00:23:11.700
Like déjà vu, my distant memories

00:23:11.700 --> 00:23:13.370
keep coming back to me.

00:23:13.660 --> 00:23:17.580
It's just like reincarnation.

00:23:17.580 --> 00:23:21.960
With my head still in the clouds,

00:23:21.960 --> 00:23:26.130
I'm running off somewhere again.

00:23:27.920 --> 00:23:33.140
Will enough tears make me give up?

00:23:33.140 --> 00:23:39.180
Will enough lives make my dream come true?

00:23:46.320 --> 00:23:51.450
You will be going through the selection process for the 77th generation.

00:23:51.450 --> 00:23:54.950
These are idol lessons?!

00:23:54.950 --> 00:23:56.780
Why don't you go home then?

00:23:56.780 --> 00:23:58.750
She wasn't like that before!

00:23:58.750 --> 00:24:01.040
Chieri's changed.

00:23:58.750 --> 00:24:01.040
- Stardust Selection-
